        "text": "R Visualization Pipeline\n\nDemonstrates BioNodulo's R integration using ggplot2 and pheatmap.\n\nChain 1: Build a QC metrics DataFrame and plot a grouped bar chart.\nChain 2: Build an expression DataFrame and plot a colored scatter plot.\nChain 3: Load a gene expression matrix and generate a clustered heatmap with pheatmap.\n\nRequires: R + ggplot2 + pheatmap + RColorBrewer installed."
      },
